# NOTE on artifacts:
# Deploying to Streamlit Community Cloud: the app needs the trained model and
# result artifacts to work. The raw dataset auto-downloads from the official
# UCI source on first run, so only these small generated files (all <1 MB)
# are committed here - they are outputs of our own verified experiments.
# To go back to a clean repo, regenerate everything with: python -m src.train
